 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545791,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If a person’s height is 6 ft 2 in, what is the approximate length from their belly button to the floor rounded to the nearest inch if the ratio is golden?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>According to the golden ratio, ideally the ratio of a person’s height to the length from their belly button to the floor is approximately 1.618.</p>\n<p>Convert 6 ft 2 in to inches.</p>\n<p>6 ft is 72 inches.</p>\n<p>6 ft 2 inches is 72 inches + 2 inches = 74 inches</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"1.618 = \\frac{{74}}{x}\"></span></td>\n<td>Multiply.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"1.618x = 74\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = \\frac{{74}}{{1.618}} \\approx 46{\\rm{\\ inches}}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The approximate length from their belly button to the floor is 46 inches.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "46 in"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
